                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Wraps each node call with:\n        \u2022 deterministic spans\n        \u2022 node lifecycle events\n        \u2022 structured failure handling\n        \u2022 typed node metadata\n\n    Returns:\n        - The result of fn() OR\n        - None on error (caller is responsible for fallback behavior).\n    ",
